{
  "about": "Cases for CropResolver - the PHP class and the editor's copy in the browser must both pass them. Crops are given by their alignment (ax, ay - Media\\CropBox) and basis ('fill' when not given: 0 flush left / top, 1 flush right / bottom, 0.5 centred, scale 1 = fill in; 'fit': 0 the picture touches the crop on the left / top, 1 on the right / bottom, scale 1 = fit in) in the master; POIs by their centre (x, y) and size (w, h), fractions of the master. Expected values were worked out by an independent implementation of the rules in .cursor/docs/media-crops.md, to 1e-6.",
